name=HARMONIE - SVU3 Part Wear
id=HARMONIE_SVU3PartWear
description=Adds a sandbox multiplier for how much condition Standardized Vehicle Upgrades 3's own protection/armor add-on parts (bullbars, window/door/trunk armor, wheel chains) lose each time they absorb damage for the vehicle part they protect. SVU3 ships fixed per-tier values with no overall multiplier -- this adds one, so those parts can be made to break down faster (or slower) than SVU3's own defaults. Requires tsarslib and Standardized Vehicle Upgrades 3 (Core).
poster=poster.png
modversion=1.0
versionMin=42.0.0
require=tsarslib,StandardizedVehicleUpgrades3Core
